{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"To factor means to rewrite an expression as a product. Let's try dividing the expression $24m-12p+72$ by each factor.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $6$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}24m-12p+72\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{24m-12p+72}{6}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6\\left(\\dfrac{24m}{6}-\\dfrac{12p}{6}+\\dfrac{72}{6}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=6(4m-2p+12)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $24m-12p+72$ is *not* equivalent to $6(4m+2p+12)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $2$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}24m-12p+72\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{24m-12p+72}{2}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\left(\\dfrac{24m}{2}-\\dfrac{12p}{2}+\\dfrac{72}{2}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2(12m-6p+36)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $24m-12p+72$ is equivalent to $2(12m-6p+36)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $12$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}24m-12p+72\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12\\left(\\dfrac{24m-12p+72}{12}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12\\left(\\dfrac{24m}{12}-\\dfrac{12p}{12}+\\dfrac{72}{12}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=12(2m-p+6)\n\\end{align}$\n\nYes, $24m-12p+72$ is equivalent to $12(2m-p+6)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"####Factoring out $24$\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}24m-12p+72\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=24\\left(\\dfrac{24m-12p+72}{24}\\right)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=24\\left(\\dfrac{24m}{24}-\\dfrac{12p}{24}+\\dfrac{72}{24}\\right) \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=24(m-0.5p+3)\n\\end{align}$\n\nNo, $24m-12p+72$ is *not* equivalent to $24(m-12p+3)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following expressions are equivalent to $24m-12p+72$:\n\n- $2(12m-6p+36)$\n- $12(2m-p+6)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Factor $24m-12p+72$ to identify the equivalent expressions.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24m+12p+72$.","content":"$6(4m+2p+12)$","correct":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24m-12p+72$.","content":"$2(12m-6p+36)$","correct":true},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24m-12p+72$.","content":"$12(2m-p+6)$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"clue":"This expression is equivalent to $24m-288p+72$.","content":"$24(m-12p+3)$","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":true,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":true,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
